matrix Axes

axis Effort [from: low, to: high]
axis Impact [from: low, to: high]

box now as Do now
box plan as Plan it
box spare as When free
box drop as Skip

item login as Faster login
item old as Rebuild old screen

step Horizontal axis
  say The first axis line is the horizontal axis, drawn below the areas from left to right.
    from is the text at the left end and to the text at the right end.
  line now: login

step Vertical axis
  say The second axis line is the vertical axis, drawn left of the areas from bottom to top.
    The name and both ends sit outside the axis.
  line drop: old
